From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: git ref fetch: support patterns and commit IDs

Accept multiple refs in one atomic operation, expand one-wildcard ref
patterns, canonicalize partial ref names, and import full Git object IDs
anonymously. Keep list/forget name handling consistent

Include command coverage and the matching documentation
